WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.935
-My first guest is the
creator and star of

00:00:02.935 --> 00:00:04.637
the Emmy-winning animated series
"Big Mouth."

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.005
He's one of my
all-time favorites.

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:10.376
It premieres its fourth season
this Friday on Netflix.

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:14.447
Here is Nick Kroll.
There -- Look at this. Wow!

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:15.648
Oh, you're waving.
-Hi.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:17.083
-Let me -- You're waving
with the wrong --

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:19.919
No, wave with the other --
Stop.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.387
-Is this it?
-Slower.

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:23.389
-No, other hand.

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:24.957
Is that a ring?
-Is this the framing?

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:26.559
-Is that the ring?
-Oh, this is a ring.

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:28.861
-Nick Kroll,
you got married, buddy.

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:29.929
-Yeah.
-Yeah!

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:31.196
-I got married.
Can you see it?

00:00:31.196 --> 00:00:33.499
-Yes. It's beautiful.

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:35.502
-I've turned off self view
on Zoom

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:37.803
so not to look at myself
the entire interview.

00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:39.638
-Oh, interesting.
-I got married.

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:41.373
Yeah.
-That's amazing, buddy.

00:00:41.373 --> 00:00:43.709
From the photo that you
posted on Instagram --

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:44.777
Look at that.

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:46.412
Are you kidding me?

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:48.581
That is a gorgeous setting
for a wedding.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.783
Where even is that?

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:56.122
-We were on a cliff in
California, in Big Sur.

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:59.158
And it was
really, really beautiful.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:00.893
And it was just us.

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.361
It was really --
It was pretty magical.

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:03.463
It was pretty beautiful.
-That's great.

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:04.697
-Yeah.

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.399
-Do you mind me asking,
how was the proposal?

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.500
Were you nervous?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.502
Did you talk it out
ahead of time?

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:12.105
Did you plan it out?
Was it a bit? Was it funny?

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:14.574
-It was -- No, you know,
we've been in --

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:15.675
I don't know if
you know this, Jimmy,

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:18.077
but we've been in
this global pandemic.

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:19.311
I don't know if you're
aware of it, but --

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:21.848
Yeah, write it down.

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:23.782
"Global pandemic."

00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:28.321
-Is that L-E? Global?
-Yes, global. Yes.

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:32.424
And so I haven't
really seen many people.

00:01:32.424 --> 00:01:34.326
Like, we're all just
kind of in our homes

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:37.230
and doing our very small lives.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.700
And so I've been
largely with my fiancée,

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.669
and then so I had --
At the time, we were dating.

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:44.837
I wasn't sure
how to propose to her.

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:46.672
I couldn't talk to her about it.
-Yeah.

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:51.744
-So, I had just started working
on this movie called

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:54.680
"Don't Worry Darling"
that Olivia Wilde is directing.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:55.948
-Oh, yeah.

00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:58.617
-And it's starring
Harry Styles and Florence Pugh

00:01:58.617 --> 00:02:00.085
and a really great cast.

00:02:00.085 --> 00:02:02.521
-Oh, yeah,
I know about this, yeah.

00:02:02.521 --> 00:02:05.625
-And, so, we -- I was, like,
at the table read with them,

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:08.160
and we -- I knew
I wanted to propose

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.762
and I hadn't really been able to
talk to anybody about like,

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:11.063
"How do I do this?"

00:02:11.063 --> 00:02:14.934
So, I sort of ran through
some ideas with them and --

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.436
-With Florence and Harry Styles?

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:18.104
-Yeah, yeah.

00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:20.673
I was like -- I was just,
you know, spit-balling

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:24.510
with "Flo" and "H-Bomb,"
and, you know, my --

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:26.745
And, so, we -- And Olivia.

00:02:26.745 --> 00:02:28.414
And we were all just sort of
chatting about it,

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.883
and I came up with
an idea that I liked,

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:33.319
which was to -- Like, we had
just moved into a new house.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:36.188
And, so, I -- We were moving,

00:02:36.188 --> 00:02:39.892
and so I put a huge bouquet of
flowers into a moving box

00:02:39.892 --> 00:02:43.529
and then the ring at the center
of the flowers.

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:48.868
And my now-wife was, like,
moving stuff in the closet,

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.603
and I was like, "Hey, Lily,
can you come in here

00:02:50.603 --> 00:02:52.939
and move this --
Can you open this one box?"

00:02:52.939 --> 00:02:54.774
And she was like,
"I'm in the closet --"

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.442
you know, like,
just annoyed, moving,

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:58.478
like, "What do you --
Just let me..."

00:02:58.478 --> 00:03:02.181
And then she came out and
opened the box and saw the ring

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:07.019
and the flowers and, you know,
was very surprised.

00:03:07.019 --> 00:03:10.723
And, you know, she said yes.
-Aww! That's great.

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:13.559
-And we were, like,
getting ready to, like,

00:03:13.559 --> 00:03:15.828
call our parents
and, you know, like,

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:17.930
take a picture
and all that stuff,

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:23.703
and Harry Styles texted me to be
like, "Have you done it yet?

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:25.370
Like, what's going on?"

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:27.540
-Dude, he's the best dude ever.
-And I was like -- Yeah.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.176
And I was like,
"Yes. She said yes."

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:33.446
And, so, Harry Styles was
the first person

00:03:33.446 --> 00:03:34.881
to know that we were
getting married.

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:38.884
Like, before my parents,
before Lily's parents,

00:03:38.884 --> 00:03:40.186
before anybody,

00:03:40.186 --> 00:03:43.288
like, Harry was
the first person to know.

00:03:43.288 --> 00:03:46.425
And he gave us his blessing,
and it meant the world.

00:03:46.425 --> 00:03:50.529
-Is that -- That is perfect.
He is such a classy dude.

00:03:50.529 --> 00:03:51.831
-He really is.

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:54.900
And then we got -- When we got
married in Big Sur,

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:58.437
he sent us a huge bouquet
of flowers.

00:03:58.437 --> 00:04:04.009
And, like, just so lovely
and kind,

00:04:04.009 --> 00:04:06.846
and he doesn't know this yet,
but he is now going to be

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:08.481
the guardian
of all of our children.

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:09.515
-Oh, my God.

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:10.583
I don't know if
he agreed to that.

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:12.918
That's unbelievable.
H-Bomb himself.

00:04:12.918 --> 00:04:14.721
-The man.
-Yeah.

00:04:14.721 --> 00:04:17.590
I want to talk about
"Big Mouth," Season 4.

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.025
This is everyone's
favorite show.

00:04:19.025 --> 00:04:20.159
Everyone loves it.

00:04:20.159 --> 00:04:21.527
They're like,
"Did you see 'Big Mouth'?"

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:23.829
I go, "Yeah, I've seen it.
Yeah, he's been on the show.

00:04:23.829 --> 00:04:24.930
Yeah, we know him."

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:28.133
Season 4 coming to Netflix
this Friday.

00:04:28.133 --> 00:04:30.636
It takes place at a summer camp,
which I've never been to.

00:04:30.636 --> 00:04:32.571
You went to summer camp
as a kid?

00:04:32.571 --> 00:04:36.275
-Yes, I went to --
So, summer camp, a lot of --

00:04:36.275 --> 00:04:38.076
I went to summer camp
growing up in Maine,

00:04:38.076 --> 00:04:41.547
this camp called Wildwood,
and Andrew Goldberg,

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:43.615
who I created "Big Mouth" with,

00:04:43.615 --> 00:04:46.318
alongside Mark Levin
and Jennifer Flackett --

00:04:46.318 --> 00:04:48.253
he and I grew up together,

00:04:48.253 --> 00:04:50.523
and we went to summer camp
together as kids.

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:54.527
And so we pulled a lot of stuff
from that experience.

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:57.130
Like, we had a --
I had a camp best friend,

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.898
and when Andrew
came to join me at camp,

00:04:59.898 --> 00:05:02.568
they became best friends.

00:05:02.568 --> 00:05:05.705
And so we brought in
a new character.

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:09.208
Seth Rogen is our camp --
my camp best friend,

00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:12.478
and his name is Seth --
in the show is Seth Goldberg,

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:14.013
because I had Andrew Goldberg,

00:05:14.013 --> 00:05:17.182
and Seth's writing and directing
partner is Evan Goldberg.

00:05:17.182 --> 00:05:21.087
And Seth and I realized
that it's in the Bible that,

00:05:21.087 --> 00:05:23.089
"Thou shalt not covet
thy neighbor's wife.

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:26.259
and "Thou shalt have a Goldberg
that one grows up with

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:29.662
and then writes
TV and movies with."

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:30.729
-That's correct. That's correct.

00:05:30.729 --> 00:05:33.265
-It's a rich part
of the Jewish tradition.

00:05:33.265 --> 00:05:35.301
-I want to show a clip,
everyone.

00:05:35.301 --> 00:05:37.570
Here's a look at Season 4
of "Big Mouth,"

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.637
out this Friday on Netflix.

00:05:38.637 --> 00:05:39.639
Check it out.

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:41.340
-I'm freaking out.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.775
-[ Echoing ]
Are you having a panic attack?

00:05:43.775 --> 00:05:45.244
-What? Who said that?

00:05:45.244 --> 00:05:46.512
-Me! I did.

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:48.047
-Aah! What the hell are you?!

00:05:48.047 --> 00:05:50.282
-I'm Tito, the anxiety mosquito.

00:05:50.282 --> 00:05:52.618
-Anxiety mosquito?
Ow!

00:05:52.618 --> 00:05:54.087
-I'm sorry.
People hate it when I do that.

00:05:54.087 --> 00:05:55.388
People hate it
when I do everything.

00:05:55.388 --> 00:05:57.522
But do I stop?
-Ugh!

00:05:57.522 --> 00:05:58.958
-You killed me.

00:05:58.958 --> 00:06:00.626
I get it. I'm the worst.

00:06:00.626 --> 00:06:01.760
But so are you.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:03.562
-I know. Andrew hates me.

00:06:03.562 --> 00:06:04.897
-And so does Seth.

00:06:04.897 --> 00:06:06.198
They're probably making fun
of you right now.

00:06:06.198 --> 00:06:07.299
-You think so?

00:06:07.299 --> 00:06:09.101
-Here's what
they're definitely saying.

00:06:09.101 --> 00:06:11.704
"Nick is a whiny little baby."

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:14.306
"Let's jerk off on his pillow."
[ Laughs ]

00:06:14.306 --> 00:06:16.542
-No! Please stop
saying this stuff.

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:18.277
-You're going to have
the worst summer.

00:06:18.277 --> 00:06:20.412
Everyone's going to hate you.

00:06:20.412 --> 00:06:22.515
-Nick and I are playing
"Guess the Impression"

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:23.515
when we come back.

00:06:23.515 --> 00:06:24.550
Come on back, everybody.

